##  Dataset Description

### Input: `dirty_shipments.csv`
Raw shipment data containing **25 records** with various data quality issues:

| Column | Description | Issues Present |
|--------|-------------|----------------|
| `shipment_id` | Unique shipment identifier | None |
| `origin_warehouse` | Departure warehouse | Inconsistent case, whitespace |
| `destination_city` | Delivery city | Leading/trailing spaces |
| `destination_state` | State code | Lowercase, missing values |
| `carrier` | Shipping carrier | Inconsistent case, formatting |
| `ship_date` | Shipment date | Multiple date formats |
| `delivery_date` | Delivery date | Missing values, before ship_date |
| `weight_kg` | Shipment weight (kg) | Negative values, zeros |
| `freight_cost` | Shipping cost | Outliers (15,000), missing values |
| `shipment_status` | Current status | Inconsistent case, typos |
| `items_count` | Number of items | Negative values |
| `damage_reported` | Damage indicator | String 'NULL', inconsistent case |

